{"id": "sfpuc-underground-express-bribes", "title": "Equipment dealer admitted bribing two San Francisco utility employees", "seconds": 86.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.079, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "50b74350ae66f77c", "words": 208, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Sheldon Morris bought and sold used municipal equipment.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.39, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "received", "the", "checks?"], "sub": "San Francisco Public Utilities Commission"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.85, 1.21, 1.44, 1.99, 2.24, 2.71]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Two San Francisco utility employees received personal payments from him.", "t0": 3.51, "t1": 7.91, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sentence", "text": "Municipal equipment", "kicker": "Federal sentencing release", "mark": "Municipal equipment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.76, 1.39, 1.97, 2.71, 3.14, 3.61, 3.99, 4.18]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "His company, Underground Express, also hauled equipment to recyclers.", "t0": 8.03, "t1": 13.06, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sentence", "kicker": "Equipment dealer", "text": "Underground Express", "mark": "Underground Express"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 1.14, 1.74, 2.89, 3.5, 3.77, 4.2, 4.33]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "From 2002 through 2007, Morris paid the employees for commission business.", "t0": 13.18, "t1": 19.15, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sentence", "kicker": "San Francisco", "text": "2002 through 2007", "mark": "2002 through 2007"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.47, 0.95, 1.31, 1.58, 1.85, 2.31, 3.21, 3.64, 3.96, 4.08, 4.81, 4.98, 5.42]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "One received checks. The other received checks and cash.", "t0": 19.27, "t1": 22.76, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "sentence", "heading": "Two SFPUC employees", "context": "Approximate payments", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"label": "Checks", "value": "$4,575", "icon": "file"}, {"label": "Checks and cash", "value": "$13,348.50", "icon": "file"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.68, 1.6, 1.82, 2.06, 2.5, 2.84, 2.96]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The San Francisco bribes totaled about $17,923.50.", "t0": 22.88, "t1": 29.71, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$17,923.50", "label": "Approximate bribes to two employees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.42, 1.05, 1.6, 1.99, 2.26, 2.84, 3.68, 4.06, 4.45, 5.04, 5.78, 6.02, 6.38]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Morris pleaded guilty in July 2008.", "t0": 29.93, "t1": 32.84, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sentence", "kicker": "Guilty plea", "text": "July 25, 2008", "mark": "July 25, 2008"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.83, 1.22, 1.33, 1.88, 2.13, 2.59]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Federal prosecutors also traced bribes to Sacramento and Sonoma.", "t0": 32.96, "t1": 36.64, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Sacramento and Sonoma"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 1.2, 1.59, 1.92, 2.36, 2.49, 3.03, 3.15]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Across all three cities, Morris admitted paying over 200,000 dollars.", "t0": 36.76, "t1": 41.78, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$200,000", "label": "More than this amount across three cities"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.75, 1.04, 1.89, 2.33, 2.74, 3.14, 3.44, 3.78, 4.09, 4.5]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In May 2009, a federal judge sentenced Morris to 33 months.", "t0": 41.9, "t1": 46.12, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sentence", "kicker": "Federal sentence", "text": "33 months", "mark": "33 months"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.45, 0.66, 1.07, 1.45, 1.57, 1.92, 2.23, 2.65, 2.99, 3.13, 3.73]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The judge ordered restitution to all three cities.", "t0": 46.24, "t1": 48.85, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Restitution to three cities"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.85, 1.5, 1.63, 1.84, 2.1]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "San Francisco’s share was $19,762.90.", "t0": 48.97, "t1": 55.82, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$19,762.90", "label": "Restitution ordered for San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.98, 1.32, 1.55, 2.02, 2.86, 3.3, 3.98, 4.83, 5.58, 6.0, 6.39]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A federal judge later ordered Charles Schwab to release funds.", "t0": 55.94, "t1": 59.41, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "garnish", "kicker": "Federal court", "text": "Order of garnishment", "mark": "Order of garnishment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.53, 0.96, 1.29, 1.58, 1.99, 2.44, 2.57, 2.92]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The order directed payments to the federal clerk.", "t0": 59.53, "t1": 61.85, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "garnish", "heading": "Payments to the United States", "context": "November 2009", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"label": "First payment", "value": "$100,000", "icon": "file"}, {"label": "Further payment", "value": "$76,053.03", "icon": "file"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.48, 0.91, 1.35, 1.47, 1.56, 1.91]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "San Francisco also sued Morris, Alexander Deanda and Gerald Lyons.", "t0": 62.07, "t1": 66.59, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ordinance", "kicker": "City civil case", "text": "November 24, 2008", "mark": "November 24, 2008"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.82, 1.2, 1.48, 2.13, 2.75, 3.45, 3.66, 4.0]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2011, the Board authorized a settlement with two defendants.", "t0": 66.71, "t1": 70.81, "shot": "r15", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "Board of Supervisors", "text": "Ordinance 23-11", "mark": "Ordinance 23-11"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.5, 1.22, 1.39, 1.83, 2.46, 2.54, 2.96, 3.16, 3.41]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The terms specified 45,000 dollars from Deanda.", "t0": 70.93, "t1": 74.04, "shot": "r16", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "ordinance", "heading": "Partial civil settlement", "context": "February 2011", "layout": "amounts", "rows": [{"label": "Deanda", "value": "$45,000", "icon": "file"}, {"label": "Lyons", "value": "$30,000", "icon": "file"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.65, 1.27, 1.77, 2.16, 2.49, 2.66]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Lyons was to pay 30,000 dollars.", "t0": 74.16, "t1": 76.45, "shot": "r17", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$30,000", "label": "Lyons settlement terms"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.54, 0.64, 0.96, 1.34, 1.75]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The ordinance authorized 75,000 dollars in all.", "t0": 76.57, "t1": 80.05, "shot": "r18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$75,000", "label": "Partial civil settlement authorized"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.69, 1.35, 2.2, 2.66, 3.03, 3.16]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The City’s actual collections remain an open question.", "t0": 80.17, "t1": 83.02, "shot": "r19", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Clerk disbursements", "City receipts"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.55, 1.01, 1.65, 1.96, 2.06, 2.32]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 83.14, "t1": 85.6, "shot": "r20", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.85, 1.03, 1.31, 1.38, 1.48, 1.73, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The equipment dealer", "b": "The federal sentence", "o": "The City’s civil case"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}